<Example Source="DatePickerTime.razor"><DatePickerTime /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Natural Language Picker</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    shadcn's parses "next tuesday" in the browser. Parsing a date is the server's job here — it
    already has to, because a client-side parse is a convenience and the value still arrives as
    text — and <code>up-validate</code> echoes back what it understood, so the reader sees the
    interpretation before submitting rather than after.
</p>
<Example Source="DatePickerNatural.razor"><DatePickerNatural /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Calendar</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    When the shape of the month is the information rather than the value, that is
